    <briefdescription>
<para>Thin client that activates and periodically validates a ThemisDB license against the ThemisDB license server. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The client operates in three modes:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Online mode</bold> – Contacts the license server via HTTPS to activate or refresh the license. Returns the authoritative <ref refid="structthemis_1_1license_1_1_license_data" kindref="compound">LicenseData</ref> from the server.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Grace mode</bold> – If the online check fails (network unavailable), the previously cached / embedded license is used for up to <computeroutput>config.grace_period_days</computeroutput> days.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Offline mode</bold> – If <computeroutput>allow_offline = true</computeroutput>, permanently falls back to the embedded license without ever contacting the server. </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
